Fix RPMC BIOS issue with CrashLog pop-up

[Issue Description]
A previous bug fix made the CopyMem() in
ProtectedVariableLibGetByName() conditional but it needs
to always happen as the 'Data' and 'VarInfo.PlainData'
do not always point to the same buffer.

[Resolution]
Always do a copy of the 'VarInfo.PlainData' back to the 'Data'
buffer that was passed in by caller.

